<title>UK: IMI says to buy TA Hydronics for 97 mln stg.</title>
<headline>IMI says to buy TA Hydronics for 97 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's IMI Plc said on Thursday that it had agreed to acquire TA Hydronics from Swedens' Incentive group for 97 million pounds ($159.2 million).</p>
<p>TA Hydronics is a producer of balancing valves, radiator and shut-off valves and components used in hydronic systems. IMI said the acquisition would enhance the group's earnings per share in the year to December 1997.</p>
</text>
